# Beast 3.0 Quality Assurance & Testing Division

The Quality Assurance & Testing Division enforces rigorous verification, automated testing, and vulnerability scanning for all codebases and smart contracts across the Beast 3.0 framework.

## Mission

Guarantee absolute software reliability, security compliance, and zero regression across all 21 division repositories prior to production release.

## Core Responsibilities

- Automated Integration Test Suite Execution
- Static Code Analysis & Vulnerability Scanning (Slither/Foundry)
- Fuzz Testing & Edge Case Validation
- QA Pipeline Certification

## Connected Systems

- Research & Development Division (`div-17-research-dev`)
- Cyber Security & Defense Division (`div-07-security-firewall`)
- System Orchestrator (`div-21-system-orchestrator`)

## Status

Development
